{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>יתן אוכל למכביר</b> — from כביר, meaning 'in abundance,' or למכביר from the root בכר. R. Moses the Kohen said: this verse is connected with 'על כפים' (Job 36:32). This is not correct at all, as I mentioned in the book Moznei ha-Lashon."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:45.796878882Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}